Ask user for bill amount.
Ask user how many people.
Ask user how was service, good or okay or bad.
If service is good, tip is 20 percent of bill.
If service is okay, tip is 15 percent of bill.
If service is bad, tip is 10 percent of bill.
Total is bill plus tip.
Each person pay total divide by people.
Show tip in dollar.
Show total in dollar.
Show each person pay in dollar.
